-- Ekwo OS — Malta: chart of accounts, journals, taxes and defaults.
--
-- Generated from packs/mt at version 0.1.0, do not edit.
-- Change the pack and run `ekwo pack build mt`; `ekwo pack check --all`
-- refuses a seed that is not the exact output of its pack, and the CI runs it.
--
-- Community pack — not reviewed.
-- Written from:
--   Value Added Tax Act (Chapter 406 of the Laws of Malta), consolidated text (Ministry for Justice — legislation.mt)
--     https://legislation.mt/eli/cap/406/eng
