--     https://legislation.mt/eli/cap/13/eng
--   Companies Act (Chapter 386 of the Laws of Malta), consolidated text (Ministry for Justice — legislation.mt)
--     https://legislation.mt/eli/cap/386/eng
--   Accountancy Profession (General Accounting Principles for Small and Medium-Sized Entities) Regulations (S.L. 281.05), Section 4 — Presentation of Financial Statements (Ministry for Justice — legislation.mt)
--     https://legislation.mt/eli/sl/281.5/eng
--   VAT Return (specimen), Office of the Commissioner for Revenue (Office of the Commissioner for Revenue / Malta Tax and Customs Administration)
